abstract: >
  Research software for combinatorics and number theory. This snapshot
  repairs coprime Ramsey proof-status handling, complete-witness validation,
  and bounded counting, and includes independently checked witnesses at
  n=10, 58, and 52 with dated correction and verification records. The
  coprime Lean formalization remains incomplete; reported longer path
  thresholds have not been independently reproduced.
